  "totalBlocks": 89,
  "translatedBlocks": 89,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd0601c63ed2b496",
      "translationZh": "AI WebTV 是一个实验性演示项目，旨在展示自动视频与音乐合成领域的最新进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "092bbdbd9921e063",
      "translationZh": "👉 立即前往 AI WebTV Space 观看直播。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6522310530aeafbc",
      "translationZh": "如果你使用的是移动设备，可以通过 Twitch 镜像观看直播。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "54287be80625eb6d",
      "translationZh": "构想",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddc465fd431ccf9c",
      "translationZh": "AI WebTV 的初衷是以有趣且易于体验的方式，展示使用 Zeroscope 和 MusicGen 等开源文本生成视频模型生成的视频。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec259a893a0bf2d7",
      "translationZh": "你可以在 Hugging Face hub 上找到这些开源模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d3c8cf2f35959bc1",
      "translationZh": "用于视频：zeroscope_v2_576 和 zeroscope_v2_XL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1741f595de6a749d",
      "translationZh": "用于音乐：musicgen-melody",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e21daa0a04384164",
      "translationZh": "各个视频片段都被刻意制作得很短，这意味着 WebTV 应被视为技术演示或作品展示集，而非真正的节目（具有艺术指导或节目编排）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cd74053c54816e47",
      "translationZh": "架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eec8f3560f111732",
      "translationZh": "AI WebTV 的工作方式是接收一系列视频镜头提示词，并将它们传递给文本生成视频模型，以生成一系列拍摄片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb33c3c8c21f3283",
      "translationZh": "此外，还会将一个基础主题和创意（由人类撰写）传递给一个大语言模型（此处为 ChatGPT），以便为每个视频片段生成多种不同的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45007f0e4a87dff7",
      "translationZh": "以下是 AI WebTV 当前架构的示意图：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "370e2a8236c92576",
      "translationZh": "实现处理流水线",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4ebf097fb1fcf93",
      "translationZh": "WebTV 使用 NodeJS 和 TypeScript 实现，并使用托管在 Hugging Face 上的各种服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e6e44ce7e84162a1",
      "translationZh": "文本生成视频模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "404831be5e724ddb",
      "translationZh": "核心视频模型是 Zeroscope V2，这是一个基于 ModelScope 的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbd4c48f4b6845da",
      "translationZh": "Zeroscope 由两个可以串联使用的部分组成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e51b5f945570ff87",
      "translationZh": "第一轮使用 zeroscope_v2_576，生成一段 576x320 的视频片段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5fe1a1921c03ee7a",
      "translationZh": "可选的第二轮使用 zeroscope_v2_XL，将视频分辨率提升至 1024x576",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74dfa05caadb4bc2",
      "translationZh": "👉 生成和提升分辨率时，你需要使用相同的提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0aa4a52e8cffe906",
      "translationZh": "调用视频处理链",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48a95f83bd7e6232",
      "translationZh": "为了快速制作原型，WebTV 通过两个复制而来的、运行 Gradio 的 Hugging Face Spaces 来运行 Zeroscope，并使用 @gradio/client NPM 包调用它们。你可以在这里找到原始 Spaces：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "213c966c475b2ca1",
      "translationZh": "@hysts 的 zeroscope-v2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "68c3e5394be4b3ec",
      "translationZh": "由 @fffiloni 制作的 Zeroscope XL",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2ace0725e8ffc25",
      "translationZh": "在 Hub 上搜索 Zeroscope，还可以找到社区部署的其他 Spaces。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a73496781f7c3980",
      "translationZh": "👉 公共 Spaces 可能会因访问过多而变得拥挤，并随时暂停运行。如果你打算部署自己的系统，请复制这些 Spaces，并在你自己的账户下运行它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68629cb963ebddfc",
      "translationZh": "使用托管在 Space 上的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "998707d0288fe920",
      "translationZh": "使用 Gradio 的 Spaces 能够提供 REST API，随后可以在 Node 中使用 @gradio/client 模块调用该 API。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74dadf3576f8977e",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "10745d69ce66dbdf",
      "translationZh": "后处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "926b63ac1a9ba9ae",
      "translationZh": "单个镜头（一个视频片段）经过分辨率提升后，便会被传递给 FILM（Frame Interpolation for Large Motion，大幅运动帧插值），这是一种帧插值算法：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d55c939e2c7f15d",
      "translationZh": "原始链接：网站、源代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8608e884bf38b89",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face 上的模型：/frame-interpolation-film-style",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7c188421337e1682",
      "translationZh": "可供你复制的 Hugging Face Space：由 @fffiloni 创建的 video_frame_interpolation",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba95bdaf0fb31f97",
      "translationZh": "在后期处理过程中，我们还会添加使用 MusicGen 生成的音乐：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d55c939e2c7f15d",
      "translationZh": "原始链接：网站、源代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "793bbe162ed74974",
      "translationZh": "可供你复制的 Hugging Face Space：MusicGen",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c454b942dc11d17",
      "translationZh": "播出视频流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10b95f6d37df66cb",
      "translationZh": "注意：你可以使用多种工具来创建视频流。AI WebTV 目前使用 FFmpeg 读取由 mp4 视频文件和 m4a 音频文件组成的播放列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b942eb65f69fc97d",
      "translationZh": "下面是创建此类播放列表的示例：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29d7f04f11280215",
      "translationZh": "这将生成以下播放列表内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e76e80118c548558",
      "translationZh": "随后再次使用 FFmpeg 读取此播放列表，并向 RTMP 服务器发送 FLV 流。FLV 是一种较老的格式，但由于延迟低，在实时流媒体领域仍然很受欢迎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6900dea10c477ae2",
      "translationZh": "FFmpeg 有许多不同的配置选项，更多信息请参阅官方文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e6a94f4d0913c15",
      "translationZh": "对于 RTMP 服务器，你可以在 GitHub 上找到开源实现，例如 NGINX-RTMP 模块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b043f188fb2676c0",
      "translationZh": "AI WebTV 本身使用的是 node-media-server。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da7583cf3ac4c85f",
      "translationZh": "💡 你也可以直接向 Twitch 的某个 RTMP 接入点推流。更多详情请参阅 Twitch 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bd0ac6a0553c91a5",
      "translationZh": "观察与示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cc7a13507805984b",
      "translationZh": "以下是一些生成内容的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38c0a2c13989fd51",
      "translationZh": "我们首先注意到，使用 Zeroscope XL 进行第二轮处理会显著提升图像质量。帧插值的效果也清晰可见。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6a725af6ae771ce3",
      "translationZh": "角色与场景构图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30c3df48c7925ab4",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一段照片级写实影片，一只羊驼扮演程序员，戴着眼镜，穿着连帽衫，在温馨、灯光昏暗的房间里，全神贯注地盯着显示着一行行代码的屏幕，Canon EOS，环境光照，高细节，电影感，artstation 上的热门风格",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "730a805958ccc6f6",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一段 3D 渲染动画，展示一群食物角色叠成金字塔，一根香蕉得意洋洋地站在顶端。场景设在一座有着棉花糖云朵和巧克力道路的城市中，Pixar 风格，CGI，环境光照，阳光直射，丰富的配色，超写实，电影感，照片级写实。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce20926f5067d689",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一只赤狐的亲密特写，以锐利的目光凝视镜头，环境光照营造出高对比度的剪影，IMAX 摄影机，高细节，电影效果，黄金时刻，胶片颗粒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fe0ef830c16a758c",
      "translationZh": "动态场景模拟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95e86bb23d53747d",
      "translationZh": "文生视频模型真正令人着迷的一点，是它们能够模拟训练时接触过的现实生活现象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88c23a20143defa2",
      "translationZh": "我们已经在大型语言模型身上见识过这一点：它们能够合成模仿人类回答、令人信服的内容，但将这种能力应用于视频时，事情就进入了一个全新的维度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "91d95bf46be5bad0",
      "translationZh": "视频模型会预测场景接下来的画面，其中可能包含流体、人、动物或车辆等运动中的物体。如今，这种模拟还不完美，但评估未来模型（使用更大规模或专门的数据集，例如动物运动数据集进行训练）在重现物理现象时的准确性，以及它们模拟智能体行为的能力，将会很有意思。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce1ba39c5a43cab2",
      "translationZh": "提示词：电影级镜头，蜜蜂在一朵花周围活力十足地嗡嗡飞舞，阳光照亮整个场景，以 4k IMAX 拍摄，背景呈现柔和的散景效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a971d07c8cb5b3ee",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一只灰熊在湍急的河流中捕捉鲑鱼的动态影像，环境光凸显飞溅的水花，低角度，IMAX 摄影机，4K 电影画质，黄金时刻，胶片颗粒。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e39ac01b3e0f92d5",
      "translationZh": "提示词：加利福尼亚海岸宁静清晨的航拍影像，海浪轻轻拍打着岩石海岸。令人惊艳的日出以鲜明的色彩照亮海岸，使用 DJI Phantom 4 Pro 精美捕捉。在柔和的晨光下，景观的色彩与纹理变得鲜活起来。胶片颗粒，电影感，imax，电影",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0743aa0514baf54d",
      "translationZh": "💡 未来若能看到这些能力得到更深入的探索，将会很有意思，例如使用涵盖更多现象、更大规模的视频数据集来训练视频模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6b912fe4c349beba",
      "translationZh": "风格与特效",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da99d2775eff47d8",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一段 3D 渲染视频，一个友善的西兰花角色戴着帽子，在遍布糖果、两旁是姜饼屋的城市街道上行走，头顶是明亮的太阳和蓝天，Pixar 风格，电影感，照片级真实感，电影，环境光，自然光，CGI，广角视野，白天，超写实。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "289307198e32003d",
      "translationZh": "提示词：电影质感影片，黎明时分一名宇航员和一只美洲驼的镜头，山地景观沐浴在柔和低饱和度的色彩中，清晨薄雾，露珠在毛发上闪烁，嶙峋的山峰，复古 NASA 宇航服，Canon EOS，高度精细的皮肤，史诗般的构图，高质量，4K，artstation 上的热门作品，美丽",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75ca9fc0c0bac649",
      "translationZh": "提示词：熊猫和黑猫乘着小船顺着流动的河水而下，吉卜力工作室风格 > 电影质感，优美构图 > IMAX 摄影机摇摄跟随小船 > 高质量，电影质感，电影，薄雾效果，胶片颗粒，Artstation 上的热门作品",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c23ed0cc2993232d",
      "translationZh": "失败案例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cc395eaf66a2db3",
      "translationZh": "方向错误：模型有时难以处理运动和方向。例如，这里的片段看起来像是在倒放。此外，修饰关键词“绿色”也未被考虑在内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "276faa2217096887",
      "translationZh": "提示词：一部展示绿色南瓜落入钉床的影片，慢动作爆裂，碎块四处飞散，环境薄雾增强戏剧性打光效果，使用 IMAX 摄影机拍摄，8k 超高清，高质量，artstation 上的热门作品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df69fb5cbf9412b5",
      "translationZh": "写实场景中的渲染错误：有时我们会看到移动的竖线或波纹等伪影。目前尚不清楚是什么导致了这种情况，但可能与所用关键词的组合有关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c09a02fd774f02c",
      "translationZh": "提示词：飞越大峡谷的迷人电影镜头，岩架和高原呈现出橙色与红色的鲜明纹理。正午阳光下，深邃的阴影与火焰般的地貌形成对比，使用 DJI Phantom 4 Pro 拍摄。镜头旋转，捕捉辽阔的空间、纹理与色彩，具有 imax 画质。胶片颗粒，电影质感，电影。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd8a843272ce4196",
      "translationZh": "插入图像中的文字或物体：模型有时会将提示词中的词语注入场景，例如“IMAX”。在提示词中提及“Canon EOS”或“无人机航拍”，也可能使这些物体出现在视频中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3320881e202e0cfb",
      "translationZh": "在下面的示例中，我们注意到，“llama”这个词不仅让画面中出现了一只美洲驼，还让火焰中出现了两处“llama”字样。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b9db7bf201fe73c",
      "translationZh": "提示词：电影场景，一只美洲驼扮演消防员，身穿消防制服，在混乱的城市场景中，以充满戏剧性的姿态向熊熊烈火喷水，Canon EOS，环境光照，高质量，获奖作品，毛发细节极其丰富，电影质感，artstation 上的热门作品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0738ee00b61bc3af",
      "translationZh": "建议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b695ce07494b9f67",
      "translationZh": "根据前面的观察，可以提出以下一些初步建议：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "704cc53443959e6b",
      "translationZh": "使用视频专用的提示词关键词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67f8c674ca41fe0e",
      "translationZh": "你可能已经知道，使用 Stable Diffusion 时，如果没有在提示词中明确指定图像的某个方面，那么衣服颜色或一天中的时间等细节就可能变得随机，或被赋予某个通用值，例如中性的正午光线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad804166249077a8",
      "translationZh": "视频模型也是如此：你需要具体描述各项细节。例如，摄像机和角色的运动，以及它们的朝向、速度和方向。出于创意探索（生成想法）的目的，你可以不作具体说明，但这样可能并不总能得到你想要的结果（例如，画面中的实体以倒放的方式运动）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4675f079c1ceba1",
      "translationZh": "保持场景之间的一致性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0578800b76fe7a9",
      "translationZh": "如果你计划创建由多个视频组成的序列，就应确保在每条提示词中加入尽可能多的细节，否则在从一个序列切换到另一个序列时，可能会丢失颜色等重要细节。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "851c8c970d2d0fd7",
      "translationZh": "💡 这也会提高图像质量，因为在使用 Zeroscope XL 进行放大处理时，也会用到提示词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9070b10d7fe97e7d",
      "translationZh": "利用帧插值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf94828b2024f36a",
      "translationZh": "帧插值是一种强大的工具，可以修复细微的渲染错误，并将许多缺陷转化为特色，尤其适用于包含大量动画的场景，或可以接受卡通效果的场景。FILM 算法会结合视频片段中前后发生的内容，对帧中的元素进行平滑处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e29697d5458156fe",
      "translationZh": "当镜头平移或旋转时，这种方法在处理背景位移方面效果很好，也会为你提供创作自由，例如在生成后控制帧数，以制作慢动作效果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "31cf6469c5cc06b5",
      "translationZh": "未来工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70a73c1342376ce8",
      "translationZh": "希望你喜欢观看 AI WebTV 直播，也希望它能启发你在这一领域开展更多创作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8bb99766448a13d3",
      "translationZh": "由于这是首次尝试，许多事情并不是这次技术演示的重点：生成更长、更多样化的序列，添加音频（音效、对话），生成并编排复杂情境，或让语言模型智能体对处理流水线拥有更多控制权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67c199b4d8703907",
      "translationZh": "其中一些想法可能会融入 AI WebTV 未来的更新中，但我们也迫不及待地想看看研究人员、工程师和开发者组成的社区会带来怎样的创意！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
